  "description": "The Double Peak Comp Plus plants its lightweight 6000 series alloy boost frame with internal head tube squarely on its oversized Kenda Havoc 27.5 x 2.8\" Plus tires for an ultra compliant ride. DP Comp Plus features a semi complete Deore 10 speed drive train aided by its FSA Comet Modular 1X Boost crankset complete with 30 tooth chain ring. Versatile and fully capable, the DP Plus Comp is perfect for cross country adventure fun rides and includes a Vaxa Boost suspension fork with thru axle and 120mm of travel. The fatter Plus size tires combined with front end suspension provides a sure footed and super comfortable ride which is then complimented with a Shimano M365 Hydraulic disc brakeset.",
